00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:04.160
And because COVID is a little different and we&nbsp;
see. Without getting now into the medical part of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:10.080
it, between variants and all these other things.&nbsp;
It's likely going to be around for a while, if&nbsp;&nbsp;

